  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27510001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "哼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你怎么又受伤了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "哈哈，这是一场史无前例的成功战役！我们成功把那群野兽驱逐到了别的街区！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "我们成功把那群野兽驱逐到了别的街区！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……你是指外面的流浪猫吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "以后居住在外面的流浪手办就不需要再担心安全问题了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没想到你还会关心部族以外的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "现在的我，已经不只是血狼部族的族长了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "有了新的身份，自然要承担这个身份所带来的重量。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真是可靠呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯？你好像不怎么排斥我帮你涂料了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "我看出来了，你是一个值得信任的家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27510013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "格雷豪斯",
          "text": "小鬼，以后我的后背就交给你了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
